msgid ""
"Profiling采集指导\n"
"==================================================================================\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Profiling Collection Guide\n"
"==================================================================================\n"
""

msgid ""
"这是一份在昇腾设备上基于FSDP或MindSpeed(Megatron)后端，使用GRPO或DAPO算法进行数据采集的教程。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This tutorial describes how to collect data on Ascend devices using the FSDP or MindSpeed (Megatron) backend and the GRPO or DAPO algorithm.\n"
""

msgid ""
"配置\n"
"----\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Configuration\n"
"-------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"使用两级profile设置来控制数据采集\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Use two-level profile settings to control data collection\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 全局采集控制：使用verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml(FSDP)，或verl/trainer/config/ppo_megatron_trainer.yaml(MindSpeed)中的配置项控制采集的模式和步数。\n"
"- 角色profile控制：通过每个角色中的配置项控制采集等参数。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Global collection control: Use the configuration items in verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml (FSDP) or verl/trainer/config/ppo_megatron_trainer.yaml (MindSpeed) to control the collection mode and the number of steps.\n"
"- Role-based profiling control: Use the configuration items in each role to control collection and other parameters.\n"
""

msgid ""
"全局采集控制\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Global collection control\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过 ppo_trainer.yaml 中的参数控制采集步数和模式：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Control the collection steps and mode using the parameters in `ppo_trainer.yaml`:\n"
""

msgid ""
"-  global_profiler: 控制采集的rank和模式\n"
""
msgstr ""
"-  global_profiler: Controls the rank and mode for collection\n"
""

msgid ""
"   -  tool: 使用的采集工具，选项有 nsys、npu、torch、torch_memory。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   -  tool: The collection tool to use. Options include nsys, npu, torch, and torch_memory.\n"
""

msgid ""
"      -  nsys: NVIDIA 官方的系统级性能分析工具。\n"
"      -  npu: 华为昇腾（Ascend）芯片的原生性能分析工具。\n"
"      -  torch: PyTorch 框架内置的性能分析器。\n"
"      -  torch_memory: PyTorch 的显存轨迹分析器（基于显存历史快照功能）。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"      -  nsys: The official system-level profiling tool from NVIDIA.\n"
"      -  npu: The native profiling tool for Huawei Ascend chips.\n"
"      -  torch: The built-in profiler of the PyTorch framework.\n"
"      -  torch_memory: The device memory trace analyzer for PyTorch (based on the memory history snapshot feature).\n"
""

msgid ""
"   -  steps: 此参数可以设置为包含采集步数的列表，例如 [2, 4]，表示将采集第2步和第4步。如果设置为 null，则不进行采集。\n"
"   -  save_path: 保存采集数据的路径。默认值为 \"outputs/profile\"。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   -  steps: This parameter can be set to a list of steps to collect, for example [2, 4], indicating that step 2 and step 4 are collected. If this parameter is set to null, no collection is performed.\n"
"   -  save_path: The path for saving collected data. The default value is \"outputs/profile\".\n"
""

msgid ""
"角色profiler控制\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Role profiler control\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"在每个角色的 ``profiler`` 字段中，您可以控制该角色的采集模式。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"In the ``profiler`` field of each role, you can control the collection mode for that role.\n"
""

msgid ""
"-  enable: 是否为此角色启用性能分析。\n"
"-  all_ranks: 是否从所有rank收集数据。\n"
"-  ranks: 要收集数据的rank列表。如果为空，则不收集数据。\n"
"-  tool_config: 此角色使用的性能分析工具的配置。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"-  enable: Whether to enable performance profiling for this role.\n"
"-  all_ranks: Whether to collect data from all ranks.\n"
"-  ranks: The list of ranks from which to collect data. If it is empty, no data is collected.\n"
"-  tool_config: The configuration of the performance profiling tool that this role uses.\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过每个角色的 ``profiler.tool_config.npu`` 中的参数控制具体采集行为：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Control the specific collection behavior through the parameters in ``profiler.tool_config.npu`` for each role:\n"
""

msgid ""
"-  level: 采集级别——选项有 level_none、level0、level1 和 level2\n"
""
msgstr ""
"-  level: Collection level — options include level_none, level0, level1, and level2\n"
""

msgid ""
"   -  level_none: 禁用所有基于级别的数据采集（关闭 profiler_level）。\n"
"   -  level0: 采集高级应用数据、底层NPU数据和NPU上的算子执行详情。在权衡数据量和分析能力后，level0是推荐的默认配置。\n"
"   -  level1: 在level0基础上增加CANN层AscendCL数据和NPU上的AI Core性能指标。\n"
"   -  level2: 在level1基础上增加CANN层Runtime数据和AI CPU指标。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   -  level_none: Disables all level-based data collection (turns off profiler_level).\n"
"   -  level0: Collects high-level application data, low-level NPU data, and operator execution details on the NPU. level0 is the recommended default configuration because it balances data volume and analysis capabilities.\n"
"   -  level1: Based on level0, adds AscendCL data at the CANN layer and AI Core performance metrics on the NPU.\n"
"   -  level2: Based on level1, adds Runtime data at the CANN layer and AI CPU metrics.\n"
""

msgid ""
"-  contents: 控制采集内容的选项列表，例如\n"
"   npu、cpu、memory、shapes、module、stack。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"-  contents: A list of options that control the collection content, for example,\n"
"   npu, cpu, memory, shapes, module, and stack.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   -  npu: 是否采集设备端性能数据。\n"
"   -  cpu: 是否采集主机端性能数据。\n"
"   -  memory: 是否启用内存分析。\n"
"   -  shapes: 是否记录张量形状。\n"
"   -  module: 是否记录框架层Python调用栈信息。相较于stack，更推荐使用module记录调用栈信息，因其产生的性能膨胀更低。\n"
"   -  stack: 是否记录算子调用栈信息。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   -  npu: Specifies whether to collect device performance data.\n"
"   -  cpu: Specifies whether to collect host performance data.\n"
"   -  memory: Specifies whether to enable memory analysis.\n"
"   -  shapes: Specifies whether to record tensor shapes.\n"
"   -  module: Specifies whether to record Python call stack information at the framework layer. Compared to `stack`, using `module` to record call stack information is recommended because it generates lower performance overhead.\n"
"   -  stack: Specifies whether to record operator call stack information.\n"
""

msgid ""
"-  analysis: 是否启用自动数据解析。\n"
"-  discrete: 是否使用离散模式。\n"
"-  profile_token_start：仅在 rollout role 下生效，用于指定 rollout 解码阶段的采集起始 response token；参数合法时生效（从 0 开始，满足 ``profile_token_end > profile_token_start``，且区间在 response 长度内）。\n"
"-  profile_token_end：仅在 rollout role 下生效，用于指定 rollout 解码阶段的采集结束 response token（右边界不包含）；参数合法时生效（从 0 开始，满足 ``profile_token_end > profile_token_start``，且区间在 response 长度内）。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"-  analysis: Whether to enable automatic data parsing.\n"
"-  discrete: Whether to use discrete mode.\n"
"-  profile_token_start: Effective only under the rollout role. Specifies the starting response token for collection during the rollout decoding phase. The parameter takes effect when it is valid (starting from 0, satisfying ``profile_token_end > profile_token_start``, and the interval is within the response length).\n"
"-  profile_token_end: Effective only under the rollout role. Specifies the ending response token for collection during the rollout decoding phase (the right boundary is exclusive). The parameter takes effect when it is valid (starting from 0, satisfying ``profile_token_end > profile_token_start``, and the interval is within the response length).\n"
""

msgid ""
"示例\n"
"----\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Example\n"
"-------\n"
""

msgid ""
"禁用采集\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Disable Collection\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"端到端采集\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
