msgid ""
"进阶指南：精细化采集\n"
"--------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Advanced guide: fine-grained collection\n"
"--------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"背景与挑战\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Background and challenges\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"上述基于配置文件的采集方式虽然便捷，但在 **长序列 (Long Context)** 或 **大全局批量 (Large Global Batch Size)** 的训练场景中面临挑战。\n"
"在一个完整的训练步 (Step) 内，模型计算呈现出高频次、重复性的特征：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Although the configuration file-based collection method is convenient, it faces challenges in **Long Context** or **Large Global Batch Size** training scenarios.\n"
"Within a complete training step, model computation exhibits high-frequency, repetitive characteristics:\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. Rollout 阶段：序列生成 (Generate Sequence) 是一个自回归过程，涉及成千上万次 Decoder 模型的前向计算。\n"
"2. Training 阶段：为了控制显存峰值，verl 通常采用 Micro-Batch 策略，将庞大的数据流切分为多个微批次进行计算。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Rollout phase: Sequence generation (Generate Sequence) is an autoregressive process that involves thousands of forward computations of the Decoder model.\n"
"2. Training phase: To control peak device memory, verl typically adopts the Micro-Batch strategy and splits the massive data stream into multiple micro-batches for computation.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   - compute_log_prob (Actor/Ref)：涉及多轮纯前向传播。\n"
"   - update_policy (Actor/Critic)：涉及多轮前向与反向传播。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   - compute_log_prob (Actor/Ref): It involves multiple rounds of pure forward propagation.\n"
"   - update_policy (Actor/Critic): It involves multiple rounds of forward and backward propagation.\n"
""

msgid ""
"这种特性会导致全量 Profiling 产生海量且重复的算子记录。如下图所示：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This feature causes full profiling to generate a massive number of duplicate operator records. The following figure illustrates this:\n"
""

msgid ""
".. image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mengchengTang/verl-data/master/verl_ascend_profiler.png\n"
"   :alt: 全量 Profiling 产生海量重复算子记录示意图\n"
""
msgstr ""
".. image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mengchengTang/verl-data/master/verl_ascend_profiler.png\n"
"   :alt: Diagram showing massive duplicate operator records generated by full profiling\n"
""

msgid ""
"即使使用了 ``discrete`` 模式，单个阶段的性能数据文件仍可能达到数 TB，导致 **解析失败** 或 **可视化工具卡顿**。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Even when you use the ``discrete`` mode, performance data files for a single stage can still reach several TB, resulting in **parsing failures** or **lag in visualization tools**.\n"
""

msgid ""
"解决方案：关键路径采样\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Solution: Critical Path Sampling\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"为了解决上述问题，我们可以采用 **关键路径采样** 策略：基于 `torch_npu.profiler <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/80RC2/devaids/auxiliarydevtool/atlasprofiling_16_0038.html>`_ 提供的API接口，直接修改 Python 源码，仅采集具有代表性的数据片段（如特定 Decode Step 或首个 Micro-Batch）。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"To solve the preceding problems, you can adopt the **critical path sampling** strategy. By using the APIs provided by `torch_npu.profiler <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/80RC2/devaids/auxiliarydevtool/atlasprofiling_16_0038.html>`_, directly modify the Python source code. This allows you to collect only representative data fragments (for example, a specific Decode Step or the first Micro-Batch).\n"
""

msgid ""
"    **重要提示**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"    **Important**\n"
""

msgid ""
"    1. 本章节涉及直接修改源码。建议修改前备份文件，调试完成后恢复。\n"
"    2. 使用代码插桩采集时，请务必在 ``ppo_trainer.yaml`` 或 ``ppo_megatron_trainer.yaml`` 中**禁用全局采集** (``global_profiler: steps: null``)，以避免 Profiler 冲突。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"    1. This section involves directly modifying the source code. Back up the files before modifying them, and restore them after debugging is complete.\n"
"    2. When using code instrumentation to collect data, **disable global collection** (``global_profiler: steps: null``) in ``ppo_trainer.yaml`` or ``ppo_megatron_trainer.yaml`` to avoid Profiler conflicts.\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 添加脚本控制采集粒度\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Add a script to control collection granularity\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"    export PROFILE_STEP=2 # 采集指定步数\n"
"    export ROLLOUT_PROFILE=true\n"
"    export UPDATE_PROFILE=true\n"
"    export WITH_MODULES=false # 采集python调用栈\n"
"    export WITH_STACK=false # 采集算子调用栈\n"
"    export WITH_MEMORY=false # 采集内存\n"
"    export WITH_SHAPE=true # 采集张量形状\n"
"    export PROFILE_RANKS=0 # 采集rank0\n"
"    export UPDATE_PROFILE_PATH=\"./outputs/update_profile\"\n"
"    export ROLLOUT_PROFILE_PATH=\"./outputs/rollout_profile\"\n"
""
msgstr ""
"    export PROFILE_STEP=2 # Collect specified steps\n"
"    export ROLLOUT_PROFILE=true\n"
"    export UPDATE_PROFILE=true\n"
"    export WITH_MODULES=false # Collect Python call stacks\n"
"    export WITH_STACK=false # Collect operator call stacks\n"
"    export WITH_MEMORY=false # Collect memory\n"
"    export WITH_SHAPE=true # Collect tensor shapes\n"
"    export PROFILE_RANKS=0 # Collect rank 0\n"
"    export UPDATE_PROFILE_PATH=\"./outputs/update_profile\"\n"
"    export ROLLOUT_PROFILE_PATH=\"./outputs/rollout_profile\"\n"
""

